sc.armorfn.solar.desc=Charges all pieces of the suit at once under open sky, the helmet itself included (works with an empty helmet too): 8000 EU/s by day and 4000 EU/s at night, shared evenly. Stops while rain or snow falls on you; deserts, savannas and the Nether never get any, so there it works in any weather. A Power Chip in the chestplate: +25% per tier
