sc.manual.armor.fnhead=Suit functions
sc.manual.armor.fn.1=Every function is switched on its own: the K key (Armour settings) opens a screen with a tab per worn piece - for each function a switch and its own key (any key, a combination with Ctrl/Shift/Alt, or a middle/side mouse button) to switch it in play. A function works while its piece is charged, uses that piece's energy and heats the suit; overheating switches them off together with the chips. Dash and the annihilation pulse fire on their key (dash also on R). Economy mode halves the cost and the speed / jump strength, Combat costs 1.5 times as much but the shield reaches further and absorbing damage is cheaper.
