sc.bladefn.blade=Blade
sc.bladefn.blade.desc=Lights the blade: full damage, EU for every hit and a little every second in hand. Off it is just a hilt. Also sneak + right-click
sc.bladefn.cutting_edge=Cutting edge
sc.bladefn.cutting_edge.desc=Cobweb, leaves, wool, vines and grass are cut at once; leaves, vines and grass drop themselves, as with shears. 50 EU per block
sc.bladefn.energy_block=Energy block
sc.bladefn.energy_block.desc=Blocking (right-click) halves the damage once more on top of a sword's usual block. 100 EU per point of damage saved
sc.bladefn.armor_pierce=Armour pierce
sc.bladefn.armor_pierce.desc=Hits ignore the target's armour
sc.bladefn.deflect=Deflect
sc.bladefn.deflect.desc=Blocking turns arrows and fireballs within 3 blocks back. 100 EU per projectile
sc.bladefn.sweep=Wide sweep
sc.bladefn.sweep.desc=On its key only: a full blow to everything in an arc of 3 blocks in front. 5000 EU, +5 heat. Switching it off here is a safety catch
sc.bladefn.execute=Execute
sc.bladefn.execute.desc=A mob left under a fifth of its health after a hit dies (bosses - the dragon and the wither - excepted)
sc.bladefn.wave=Energy wave
sc.bladefn.wave.desc=On its key only: a flying cut 16 blocks ahead through everything on the way, stopped by walls. 20000 EU, +10 heat. Switching it off here is a safety catch
sc.bladefn.lunge=Lunge
sc.bladefn.lunge.desc=On its key only: a leap forward hitting everything on 6 blocks of the way. 10000 EU, +6 heat. Switching it off here is a safety catch
