sc.manual.armor.bladeshead=Energy blades
sc.manual.armor.blades.1=Three blades for the three suits, like IC2's nano saber: off it is only a hilt, lit it hits hard and costs EU per hit and a little every second in hand. Sneak + right-click switches it, right-click blocks. All its functions and their keys are in the "Blade" tab of the armour screen (K), there while the blade is in hand.
sc.manual.armor.blades.2=The blade's heat is its own, not the suit's: shown on the left under the suit's lines. At 100% the blade goes dark until it has cooled to half. The Nano blade is crafted, Quantum and Exo come from the Upgrade Station (HV / EV) keeping charge and settings.
