tile.siliconage.generatorSC.solid_fuel.name=Solid Fuel Generator
sc.generator.solid_fuel=Solid Fuel Generator
sc.manual.generator.solid_fuel=The very first generator: burns coal, charcoal, wood and any furnace fuel. Coal gives 6,400 EU.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.wind_turbine.name=Wind Turbine
sc.generator.wind_turbine=Wind Turbine
sc.manual.generator.wind_turbine=Needs a wind rotor (wears out in ~6 h of turning). Output grows with height: none at sea level, full 96 blocks above it. Each non-air block in the 5x5x5 round it takes 4%. Rain +25%, storm +50%, gusts +-10%.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.water_wheel.name=Water Wheel
sc.generator.water_wheel=Water Wheel
sc.manual.generator.water_wheel=Put it in flowing water: 4 EU/t for each side (north, south, east, west) with water flowing against it. Still water doesn't turn it.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.thermoelectric.name=Thermoelectric Generator
sc.generator.thermoelectric=Thermoelectric Generator
sc.manual.generator.thermoelectric=Peltier elements: a hot side (lava, fire) paired with a cold one (water, ice, snow). Output = pairs x (mean hot - mean cold temperature) / 8, up to 384 EU/t. Lava against ice is ~130 EU/t a pair.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.geothermal.name=Geothermal Generator
sc.generator.geothermal=Geothermal Generator
sc.manual.generator.geothermal=Burns lava: piped in, or buckets in the slot (the empty bucket stays in the slot). 4 mB/t = 256 EU/t.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.fuel_cell.name=Hydrogen Fuel Cell
sc.generator.fuel_cell=Hydrogen Fuel Cell
sc.manual.generator.fuel_cell=Hydrogen (4 mB/t) + oxygen (2 mB/t) from the air separator = 400 EU/t and water (2 mB/t) to be pumped out - with the water tank full the cell stops.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.rtg.name=Radioisotope Generator (RTG)
sc.generator.rtg=Radioisotope Generator (RTG)
sc.manual.generator.rtg=Two radioisotope capsules at 32 EU/t each. A capsule decays in ~24 h of play whether the generator runs or not - no upkeep.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.solar_nano.name=Nano Solar Panel (IV)
sc.generator.solar_nano=Nano Solar Panel (IV)
sc.manual.generator.solar_nano=Like every panel: open sky only, full output by day, half at night, 60% in the rain.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.solar_quantum.name=Quantum Solar Panel (QV)
sc.generator.solar_quantum=Quantum Solar Panel (QV)
sc.manual.generator.solar_quantum=Built from four Nano panels. Sky, day / night / rain as for every panel.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.solar_exo.name=Exo Solar Panel (XV)
sc.generator.solar_exo=Exo Solar Panel (XV)
sc.manual.generator.solar_exo=Built from four Quantum panels. The strongest solar panel.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.plasma_reactor.name=High-Pressure Plasma Reactor
sc.generator.plasma_reactor=High-Pressure Plasma Reactor
sc.manual.generator.plasma_reactor=Argon 4 mB/t + deuterium 1 mB/t = 8,192 EU/t.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.tokamak.name=Tokamak
sc.generator.tokamak=Tokamak
sc.manual.generator.tokamak=A fusion reactor in a ring of 8 tokamak coils (all eight blocks round it on its level). Ignition 10,000,000 EU, deuterium cells and a Li-blanket like the reactor; no ring, no power.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.exo_reactor.name=Exo Singularity Reactor
sc.generator.exo_reactor=Exo Singularity Reactor
sc.manual.generator.exo_reactor=Lit by a huge 100,000,000 EU charge, then runs on liquid helium cooling alone, 1 mB/t. Without helium the core heats up and the reactor shuts down - it has to be lit again.
tile.siliconage.generatorSC.creative.name=Creative Generator
sc.generator.creative=Creative Generator
sc.manual.generator.creative=Creative mode only: endless energy at the chosen tier.
