sc.tooltip.wrench.howto.electric=Sneak + right-click in the air - next mode (Rotate / Dismantle). Rotate: right-click a quarter turn, sneak + right-click face the clicked side. Dismantle: right-click a block of the mod - straight into the inventory with its charge, fuel and fluids.
sc.tooltip.wrench.howto.quantum=Sneak + right-click in the air - next mode (Rotate / Dismantle / Copy). Dismantle: right-click a block, or right-click in the air at a block up to 8 blocks away. Copy: sneak + right-click a field generator, transformer or machine to remember, right-click the same kind of block to apply (a machine's upgrades come from your inventory).
