sc.manual.machines.quarry.4=Module slots grow with the tier: LV 6, MV 10, HV 14, EV 18 (locked ones show a padlock). The Exo Drilling Rig (XV) digs nothing: its laser brings ore up from the deep - vanilla and the mod's - at 200,000 EU a haul (1 haul/s, faster with speed modules). Ore lenses (4 slots) multiply their ore's chance, the filter leaves ores out; fortune, crushing and washing work as in the quarry. Its buffer is 20M EU - wire it to an XV network.
