sc.manual.machines.quarry.5=More modules: trash disposal (junk to nothing), centrifuge (HV+), vein miner (MV+, the whole ore vein), twin drill (EV+, x2 speed and wear), fluid guard, gentle mode (leaves buildings), head repair (MV+: switch its function on and the quarry pauses until the head is whole), energy saver. Drilling rig only: resonator (+1 lens slot, up to 8), stabilizer (lenses x7, dearer hauls) and deep scanner (other mods' ores). The Functions tab now has two pages.
